note nokey.om: trnd without a key (tcp.om, review finding 16). Compose: cat tcp.om nokey.om | omc.
note tinit installs no key, so trnd must refuse with trap 8 (exit 108) before it
note returns; gate.sh corpus requires exit 108 and no NOKEY_RETURNED line.
text Mret "NOKEY_RETURNED\n"
fn tlinkout n ulong to void
end
fn main to int
tinit
v = trnd
k = write 1 Mret 0 len Mret
ret 0
end
